---
title: "College Composition II"
code: "ENG-112"
category: "english"
credits: "3"
prerequisites:
  - "2026/ENG-111"
corequisites: []
prerequisiteNote: "Prerequisite: ENG 111 Continues to develop college writing with increased emphasis on critical essays, argumentation, and research, developing these competencies through the examination of a range of texts about the human experience. Requires students to locate, evaluate, integrate, and document sources and effectively edit for style and usage. Prerequisite: Students must successfully complete ENG 111 or its equivalent, and must be able to use word processing software. Lecture 3 hours per week."
